{"id":"n15732-1-10","stage":3,"title":"개다 · 放晴","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15732-1-10-1","ko":"오늘은 기분이 좋아 보이네.","zh":"今天看起来心情不错呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기분이","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이네.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2fae29a44683e9cdd7ab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15732-1-10-2","ko":"오랜만에 맑게 갠 하늘을 보니까 기분이 상쾌하네요.","zh":"好久没见到这么晴朗的天空了，感觉心情格外清爽。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맑게","meaning":"晴朗，明朗","explanation":"맑다：晴朗，明朗；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"맑다","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66031","senseId":"2","lemma":"맑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갠","meaning":"放晴","explanation":"개다：放晴；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"개다","audio":"/audio/200417c5cf9d8420d318.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15732","senseId":"1","lemma":"개다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하늘을","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니까","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기분이","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상쾌하네요.","meaning":"清爽，清新","explanation":"상쾌하다：清爽，清新；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"상쾌하다","audio":"/audio/e6de708c58b3dd5edd6a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16227","senseId":"1","lemma":"상쾌하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"c8398a865a747883","term":"맑다","zh":"晴朗，明朗","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3","entryId":"66031","definition":"没有云雾，天气很好。","pronunciation":["막따"]},{"id":"200417c5cf9d8420","term":"개다","zh":"放晴","audio":"/audio/200417c5cf9d8420d318.mp3","entryId":"15732","definition":"雪、雨、雾等停或散后原来的阴天变得晴朗。","pronunciation":["개ː다"]},{"id":"4cd0df8d103d3a7b","term":"하늘","zh":"天空","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3","entryId":"20311","definition":"地面上无限伸展的空间。","pronunciation":["하늘"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了了解某对象的内容或状态而进行观察。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"e6de708c58b3dd5e","term":"상쾌하다","zh":"清爽，清新","audio":"/audio/e6de708c58b3dd5edd6a.mp3","entryId":"16227","definition":"心情或感觉等清凉而爽快。","pronunciation":["상ː쾌하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3412c89d948e41e7f79e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15732","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.5867,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天看起来心情不错呢。","好久没见到这么晴朗的天空了，感觉心情格外清爽。","你为什么那么怕蜘蛛啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天看起来心情不错呢。","好久没见到这么晴朗的天空了，感觉心情格外清爽。","你为什么那么怕蜘蛛啊？"],"answer":1}]}
